```

---

## Triggering the release workflow

```bash
git tag v1.1.0
git push origin v1.1.0
```

This triggers `Upload Evidence to Release`, which runs the scanner inside Docker and attaches `evidence.zip` (containing `.sarif` and `.json` outputs) to the GitHub Release.